                "evidence": "Cloudflare AI Search is free for now. Billing starts on **2026-12-01**, and each month includes a free allowance; you pay only for usage above it.\n\n**Included free each month:**\n- 5M ingestion tokens\n- 10 GB-month of storage\n- 1,000 semantic queries\n- 1,000 full-text queries\n\n**Overage:**\n- $0.75 per 1,000 hybrid queries\n- $0.10 per 1,000 full-text queries\n\n**Limits:** 50 results per query at most, and 5 custom metadata fields per instance.\n\nOne thing is unclear: the free allowance is described in \"semantic\" queries, but the overage price is for \"hybrid\" queries. They're probably the same query type, but check Cloudflare's pricing page if your costs depend on it. My source also didn't give a price for ingestion tokens or storage beyond the free amounts.\n\n**Source:** this all comes from the vault page [[Cloudflare AI Search]], which was built from Cloudflare's pricing page captured on 2026-11-01. That page was last checked 6 days ago, and pricing pages get rechecked every 30 days, so I didn't search the web again. I added an entry to the vault's research log.\n\nCoverage: vault only (one page, still current). No web searches and no paid calls."
